{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10569","headline":"洛阳道 · 冯着","name":"洛阳道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳宫中花柳春，洛阳道上无行人。\n皮裘毡帐不相识，万户千门闭春色。\n春色深，春色深，君王一去何时寻。\n春雨洒，春雨洒，周南一望堪泪下。\n蓬莱殿中寝胡人，鳷鹊楼前放胡马。\n闻君欲行西入秦，君行不用过天津。\n天津桥上多胡尘，洛阳道上愁杀人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯着","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}